  "metadata": {
    "title": "Encryption",
    "description": "How to encrypt your data with encryption v2, secure your app and ensure only you can update your users with your updates",
    "sidebar": {
      "order": 5
    }
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 2,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This documentation explains how to migrate to the encryption v2 system. Learn more about the encryption v2 system in the "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 122
          },
          "url": "/blog/introducing-end-to-end-security-to-capacitor-updater-with-code-signing/",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 2,
                "column": 123
              },
              "text": "blog post"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 212
          },
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 4,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "1. Create Key Pair"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 6,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "bash",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "npx @capgo/cli key create"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 10,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 10,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": ":::warning\nStore the private key securely. Never commit it to source control or share it with untrusted parties.\n:::"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 14,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 14,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "This command:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "location": {
        "line": 15,
        "column": 1
      },
      "ordered": false,
      "start": null,
      "spread": false,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 15,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 15,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 15,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Creates a new key pair in your app"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 16,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 16,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 16,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Removes the old key from your Capacitor config"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "location": {
            "line": 17,
            "column": 1
          },
          "spread": false,
          "checked": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "location": {
                "line": 17,
                "column": 3
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "location": {
                    "line": 17,
                    "column": 3
                  },
                  "text": "Keeps old key files for backward compatibility"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 19,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 19,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "2. Update Capacitor Config"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 21,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 21,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "When prompted \"Do you want to setup encryption with the new channel in order to support old apps and facilitate the migration?\", select yes. This adds a new "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 21,
            "column": 158
          },
          "text": "defaultChannel"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 21,
            "column": 174
          },
          "text": " option to your Capacitor config."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 23,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "ts",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "// capacitor.config.ts\nimport { CapacitorConfig } from '@capacitor/cli';\n\nconst config: CapacitorConfig = {\n  appId: 'com.example.app',\n  appName: 'Example App',\n  plugins: {\n    CapacitorUpdater: {\n      // ... other options\n      defaultChannel: 'encryption_v2' // New apps will use this channel\n    }\n  }\n};\n\nexport default config;"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 41,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 41,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "3. Upload Bundle to New Channel"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 43,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "bash",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "npx @capgo/cli bundle upload --channel encryption_v2"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 47,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 47,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "4. Enable Self-Assignment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 49,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 49,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": ":::caution\nRequired for the "
        },
        {
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "location": {
            "line": 50,
            "column": 18
          },
          "text": "defaultChannel"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 50,
            "column": 34
          },
          "text": " option to work\n:::"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 53,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "bash",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "npx @capgo/cli channel set encryption_v2 --self-assign"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 57,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 57,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "5. Upload to Old Channel"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 59,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "bash",
      "meta": null,
      "text": "npx @capgo/cli bundle upload --channel production"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 63,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 63,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": ":::tip\nCapacitor config is never uploaded to Capgo\n:::"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
